{"path":"utility/initializer_list/end","title":"std::initializer_list<T>::end","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::initializer_list&lt;T&gt;::</span>end","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/initializer_list/end","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Obtains a pointer to one past the last element in the initializer list, i.e. begin() + size().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(constexpr since C++14)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Obtains a pointer to one past the last element in the initializer list, i.e. <code class=\"t-c\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/initializer_list/begin\"><code>begin()</code></a><code>&nbsp;</code><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">+</span> size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If the initializer list is empty, the values of <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/initializer_list/begin\"><code>begin()</code></a> and <code>end()</code> are unspecified, but will be identical.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>A pointer to one past the last element in the initializer list\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;initializer_list&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;numeric&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> l <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">13</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">13</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    static_assert<span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/accumulate\"><span class=\"kw1663\">std::<span class=\"me2\">accumulate</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>l.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, l.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">13</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/initializer_list/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a pointer to the first element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/initializer_list","title":"std::initializer_list"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::initializer_list<T>::end","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Obtains a pointer to one past the last element in the initializer list, i.e. begin() + size()."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A pointer to one past the last element in the initializer list"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"begin","note":"returns a pointer to the first element"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++14"],"wordCount":98,"codeBlockCount":1}
